{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22455","headline":"九日登巴台 · 白居易","name":"九日登巴台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黍香酒初熟，菊暖花未开。\n闲听竹枝曲，浅酌茱萸杯。\n去年重阳日，漂泊湓城隈。\n今岁重阳日，萧条巴子台。\n旅鬓寻已白，乡书久不来。\n临觞一搔首，座客亦裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}